  "construction_notes": [
    {
      "text": "From the state Housing Element Annual Progress Report, through 2025.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001126",
        "SRC-001127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "29 townhome-style condominiums in five buildings across two lots. Current file 25PLN-00160 (final map); earlier 24PLN-00152 and 24PLN-00153.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001307"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CEQAnet NOE: Site 1 (0.40 acres, existing commercial building) gets 8 townhomes in two buildings; Site 2 (0.95 acres, existing motel) gets 21 townhomes in three buildings; 4 BMR units; APNs 148-09-010 and 148-09-011.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003730"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mountain View Voice: Planning Director approved the project under the city's streamlined process in February 2025; the 4 BMR units are moderate income (80% to 120% of AMI); all-electric buildings with solar; replaces a commercial building and the Country Inn Motel. A 2022 Toll Brothers proposal for 55 condominiums plus six condominiums and six ADUs did not proceed.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003732"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY: SummerHill took over from Toll Brothers, which had considered a 67-unit complex as recently as 2022; facades of brick veneer, fiber cement siding and plaster.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003731"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SummerHill Homes markets the project as Cesano: 29 three-story townhomes, 3 to 4 bedrooms, about 1,493 to 2,097 sq ft, estimated HOA dues about $588 per month; sales office at 4335 W. El Camino Real.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003729"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "State Annual Progress Report 2025 notes private financing.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001127"
      ]
    }
  ],
